      {
         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nNo previous knowledge is required to follow this guide. It is enough that History Tracers is open in your browser.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_introduction",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Introduction\n\nWhen you open History Tracers, the main content appears in the center of the screen. On the left side, there is a sidebar with the menus that give access to all sections of the site. This text explains how to navigate through those menus.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_sidebar",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### The left-side menu\n\nThe sidebar of History Tracers is represented in **Figure 1**. On wide screens, the sidebar can be hidden to give more space to the content. To show it, move the mouse cursor to the left edge of the window or use the menu button at the top-left corner. The sidebar shows several menus, each one with a title. Click on a title to expand or collapse its options, and click on an option to open that page.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
