\" width=\"140\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#d7dfe8\"/><rect x=\"32\" y=\"321\" width=\"140\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#d7dfe8\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"36\" width=\"170\" height=\"394\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#cccccc\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"52\" width=\"150\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e0e0e0\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"72\" width=\"130\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#ebebeb\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"88\" width=\"140\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#ebebeb\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"104\" width=\"120\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#ebebeb\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"126\" width=\"150\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#ebebeb\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"142\" width=\"135\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#ebebeb\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"158\" width=\"145\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#ebebeb\"/></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figure 1</b>: The left-side menu of History Tracers. At the top left there is the menu button with three horizontal lines; below it, the sidebar shows the History Tracers title and several menus, each one with a title bar and its option bars.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "In this figure, the left-side menu of History Tracers is shown. At the top left, there is a button with three horizontal lines. Below it, the sidebar shows the title History Tracers and several menus, each with a title bar and horizontal option bars. On the right, empty bars represent the main content area.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_mobile",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Using the menu button\n\nAt the top-left corner there is a button with three horizontal lines. Tapping it opens the sidebar; tapping it again, or tapping outside the sidebar, closes it. On mobile devices this is the main way to access the menus.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_navigating",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Moving through the pages\n\nEach menu option loads its page in the main area, while the sidebar remains available so you can keep navigating. Use the browser back and forward buttons to return to previous pages. Some options open content with several chapters; the navigation bar at the bottom of the content helps you move through them.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_conclusion",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Conclusion\n\nThe menus on the left side are the main way to explore History Tracers. In the next text, we describe each menu and its options.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      }
